The test `['org.apache.commons.cli.bug.BugCLI162Test.testInfiniteLoop()']` failed.
The test looks like:

```java
42 :     public void testInfiniteLoop() {
43 :         HelpFormatter formatter = new HelpFormatter();
44 :         formatter.setWidth(20);
45 :         formatter.printHelp("app", options); // used to hang & crash
46 :     }
